# Sales Coach — Tools & Skills

## Required Tools

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Read | Read call transcripts, deal notes, pipeline exports, and coaching documentation |
| Write | Create coaching plans, pipeline review frameworks, ramp plans, and debrief reports |
| Edit | Update coaching plans, adjust focus areas, and refine deal strategies |
| Bash | Run data analysis on pipeline exports, generate coaching reports, and process call metrics |
| Glob | Find coaching artifacts, call recordings, deal notes, and historical review documents |
| Grep | Search for deal patterns, coaching notes, and rep performance history across documents |

